  "body_html": "<h1>Theta Block Decomposition Setup</h1>\n<p>For the source and lifted target data, decompose the oscillator space as\n\\[\nW=V\\otimes_DV'\n= {}^\\boxplus W\\oplus{}^\\boxminus W\n=(^{b}W\\oplus{}^{a}W)\\oplus({}^{ba}W\\oplus{}^{ab}W).\n\\]\nThe residual finite symplectic quotient similarly decomposes as\n\\[\nb={}^\\boxplus b\\oplus{}^\\boxminus b.\n\\]\nThe lifted datum satisfies\n\\[\n{}^{b}\\Sigma'=\\#_C({}^{b}\\Sigma),\\qquad\n{}^{a}\\Sigma'=\\#_{{}^{a}V,{}^{a}T'}({}^{a}\\Sigma),\n\\]\nand the moment-map vector is block diagonal:\n\\[\nw={}^{b}w\\oplus{}^{a}w.\n\\]\nThe orbit stabilizer decomposes into a block-diagonal stabilizer and an off-diagonal Yu subgroup:\n\\[\nS={}^\\boxplus S\\,{}^\\boxminus J_M.\n\\]</p>",
